| `make test-changed` `[local]` | Reruns recorded failures with pytest `--lf`, using an ignored cache inside the checkout; a cold cache runs the selected suite. | `make test-changed` | [`tests.cache_dir`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Never the gate; finish with `make verify`. Refuses by name before collection if addopts or PYTEST_ADDOPTS disables cacheprovider. No coverage-based changed-file selection. | [dev-loops.md](../guides/dev-loops.md) | always |
